<title>USA: Kansas Muni Agency repriced, ylds 5.20 pct in 2007.</title>
<headline>Kansas Muni Agency repriced, ylds 5.20 pct in 2007.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-05-15</dateline>
<text>
<p>Lehman Brothers said Thursday it repriced Kansas Municipal Gas Agency's $10 million bond deal.</p>
<p>The repricing follows:  </p>
<p>Kansas Municipal Gas Agency</p>
<p>RE: $10,335,000*</p>
<p>Gas Acquisition Revenue Bonds</p>
<p>(Prepay Program - Participant Group A)</p>
<p>Series 1997 A</p>
<p>VERBAL AWARD.</p>
<p>MOODY'S: Aaa		   S&amp;P: AAA	FSA INSURED</p>
<p>DATED: 05/15/1997	    FIRST COUPON: 12/01/1997</p>
<p>DUE: 06/01</p>
<p> MATURITY		AMOUNT*    COUPON	   PRICE</p>
<p>06/01/1999		  720M    4.40  %	100.00</p>
<p>06/01/2000		  890M    4.50  %	  4.60</p>
<p>06/01/2001		  925M    5.25  %	  4.75</p>
<p>06/01/2002		  975M    5.25  %	  4.85</p>
<p>06/01/2003		1,025M    4.90  %	  4.95</p>
<p>06/01/2004		1,075M    5.00  %	  5.05</p>
<p>06/01/2005		1,130M    4.90  %	  5.10</p>
<p>06/01/2006		1,185M    4.90  %	  5.15</p>
<p>06/01/2007		2,410M    5.00  %	  5.20</p>
<p>CALL FEATURES: 06/01/2002    100.00</p>
<p>* - APPROXIMATE SUBJECT TO CHANGE</p>
<p>The compliance addendum MSRB Rule G-11 will apply.</p>
<p>The award is expected Thursday, May 15, 1997.</p>
<p>Delivery is expected on May 28, 1997.</p>
<p>This issue is book entry.  DTC is pending.</p>
<p>Lehman Brothers</p>
<p>--U.S. Municipal Desk, 212-859-1650</p>
</text>
